</span></th>
<td id="A2.T6.7.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r" style="padding:0.45pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A2.T6.7.13.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
